#23500
The Ocean~
  Just a connector zone.
Connects to old ocean at 3601 - 2 west of Black Market.
Connects to Freeport at 23557 - east to 22916, Freeport Harbor.
Connects to Pal at 23566 - north to 8101
Connects to Pirate Isles at 23553 west to 6287
~
235 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
