#23566
The Plains of Solamnia~
   After walking for 2 days you stop to gaze upon the famed Plains of
Solamnia. Made famous by its Knights and beautiful cities, the plains make
up most of the northern part of Ansalon. The terrain is very diverse, 
switching from rocky sections of hill and mountain to lush rolling grasslands.
Far to the north stands the great city of Palanthas, and farther to the 
east is rumored to be Daargard Keep, stronghold of the foul deathknight
known as Lord Soth.
~
